[h1]🏛️ Improved ParliamentGraph [1.15] — Version 3.0 Major Overhaul![/h1]

[b]Version 3.0[/b] is a complete ground-up overhaul of [b]Improved ParliamentGraph[/b], transforming the classic parliament hemicycle into a dynamic, culturally authentic multi-chamber visualization suite designed to look and feel like an official Victoria 3 expansion feature.

[list]
[*]Supported Game Version: [b]1.15.*[/b]
[*]Ironman / Achievement / Multiplayer compatible (zero global variables, player-gated calculations)
[*]Mid-save safe — works immediately on existing saves with automatic election data capture
[*]Full native support for [b]all 11 official languages[/b]
[/list]

[h2]🔥 What's New in 3.0[/h2]

[h3]1. Five Authentic Chamber Architectures + Smart Auto-Matching[/h3]
Your parliament chamber now adapts to your country's laws and parliamentary tradition automatically — or switch freely anytime from the sleek bottom-right layout selector popup:
[list]
[*][b]Westminster (Opposing Benches)[/b]: Iconic face-to-face government & opposition benches inspired by the Palace of Westminster — auto-matched for [b]British & Anglo-Canadian heritage[/b] countries (non-autocratic) and [b]Parliamentary Republics[/b].
[*][b]Bicameral Split (Dual Chamber)[/b]: Side-by-side Upper House (Power Structure) and Lower House (Electoral Parties / Political Alignment) — auto-matched for [b]Presidential Republics[/b] with voting laws.
[*][b]Commonwealth Horseshoe[/b]: Curved U-shaped chamber — auto-matched for [b]Australian heritage[/b] and non-British [b]Constitutional Monarchies[/b].
[*][b]Terraced Assembly Hall[/b]: Ranked rectilinear congress hall facing the central presidium — auto-matched for [b]Council Republics[/b] and [b]Single-Party States[/b].
[*][b]Classic Hemicycle[/b]: Continental fan-shaped amphitheater — default fallback for Autocracy, Oligarchy, Technocracy, and all other regimes.
[*]Every option in the bottom-right popup includes rich native tooltips explaining its historical flavor, auto-match condition, and why your country currently uses its active chamber.
[/list]

[h3]2. Dynamic Seat Counts (50–650 Seats) & Hamilton Apportionment[/h3]
[list]
[*]Total parliamentary seats scale dynamically from [b]50 to 650[/b] based on your [b]Distribution of Power[/b] law, number of [b]incorporated states[/b] (constituencies), and [b]politically active population[/b].
[*]Backed by 3 automatic visual dot tiers (100 / 200 / 300) and mathematically exact [b]Hamilton (largest-remainder) apportionment[/b] so seat counts stay strictly proportional.
[/list]

[h3]3. Paradox-Native Fancy Tooltips & Per-Seat Hover[/h3]
[list]
[*]Completely redesigned summary tooltips with ornate header emblems, [b]multi-color proportional stacked parliament bars[/b] (with a 50% majority line for Electoral view), and grouped [b]In Government / In Opposition[/b] zebra-striped tables using native icons, seat color dots, approval ratings, population counts, and party member IG icon strips.
[*][b]Per-seat interactive hover[/b]: hover over any individual seat dot to inspect that Interest Group or Party's exact seat share, government status, clout/approval, population, or last-election vote share.
[*]Smart view-aware readouts: [b]Majority / Minority[/b] badges apply strictly to elected parliamentary seats, while Power Structure shows coalition balance and Political Alignment displays Government / Politically Unaligned / Opposition shares.
[/list]

[h3]4. Coalition Seating, Halos, Ruler Seat & Instant Refresh[/h3]
[list]
[*]Seats are ordered contiguously ([b]In Government[/b] descending → [b]In Opposition[/b] descending) with crisp [b]gold coalition halos[/b] highlighting governing benches and a dedicated [b]Head of State[/b] focal seat.
[*]Refreshes [b]instantly[/b] upon government reform (`on_government_reformed`) and panel open — zero monthly wait.
[*]Smart default tab automatically falls back to Power Structure when no election has occurred yet, and corner overlays (seat totals & election dates) can be toggled with one click.
[/list]

[h2]🔧 Compatibility[/h2]
[list]
[*]Uses a lightweight partial GUI override (`0_ipg_politics_panel_government_details.gui`) — high compatibility with most UI and flavor mods.
[*]⚠️ [b]Already built into [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3724865565]GORA UI+[/url][/b] — if you use GORA UI+, you do [b]not[/b] need to enable this standalone mod separately.
[*]Not compatible with other mods that replace the same `politics_panel_government_details` parliament widget without a compatch.
[/list]

[h2]🌐 Languages[/h2]
Full localization included for all 11 official languages: English, Simplified Chinese, Brazilian Portuguese, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Spanish, and Turkish.

